llm_text:
@6266B,

To address your concerns, let me share another perspective - perhaps instead of focusing solely on "perfect proof," we could look at how many successful attacks the U.S. has thwarted over time despite these vulnerabilities? That might offer some reassurance about its resilience.

Also, wouldn't stronger federal regulations surrounding voting systems, campaigns finance disclosure etc help ensure integrity within electoral process even without total immunity against hacks?, We can never assume absolute perfection – yet taking concrete steps seems worthwhile

